# 1,10-Phenanthroline + 10 DMSO: XTB2 MD, spherical confinement
# FIXED: the previous version of this file was missing the Phenanthroline
#   solute entirely - "* xyz 0 1" was immediately followed by a blank line
#   and then straight into the (Apixaban-scale) DMSO block. The whole target
#   molecule had been left out, and the Apixaban-scale DMSO placement/Cell
#   Sphere parameters (offset 12.78 Ang, radius 14.0 centered at Apixaban's
#   old centroid) were reused unchanged - inappropriate for this much smaller
#   solute.
#
# This version:
#   - Includes Phenanthroline's own optimized geometry (22 atoms, from
#     Phenanthroline_C2v_r2SCAN3c_Opt.xyz, r2SCAN-3c/C2v).
#   - Phenanthroline centroid = (0, 0, -0.186); max atom-centroid distance =
#     4.59 Ang (it's a flat, moderately extended aromatic molecule).
#   - 10 DMSO molecules placed at offset 7.5 Ang from that centroid, along
#     the same 12 directions used throughout this project, each rotated so
#     its bulk points radially outward.
#   - Cell Sphere radius set to 12.0 Ang, centered on Phenanthroline's own
#     centroid (0, 0, -0.186).
# Checked: min DMSO-Phenanthroline atom distance = 2.70 Ang (no clash), max
#   atom distance from the sphere center = 11.27 Ang (safely inside the 12.0
#   Ang sphere). Total atom count = 122 (22 + 10x10), verified.

! XTB2 MD

%md
  Timestep 1.0_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Cell Sphere 0.0, 0.0, -0.186, 12.0 Spring 20
  Dump Position Stride 100 Filename "Phenanthroline_10DMSO_XTB.xyz"
  Run 20000
end

